--- make
description: A migration in database/migrations to write by hand: steps that change the tables, run by kscript db migrate. kscript db diff writes one from the models instead
category: Scripts and data
usage: <name>
example: kscript make migration add_bio_to_users
example: kscript make migration backfill_slugs
to: {{ paths.migrations }}/{{ timestamp }}_{{ snake }}{{ ext }}
hint: Add its steps, then run kscript db migrate. kscript db rollback undoes it.
---
// {{ title }}: run by kscript db migrate, undone by kscript db rollback.
KScript.Migration {
  // TODO: Add the steps: CreateTable, AddField, ChangeField, AddIndex, Sql and the rest.
}
